        "message": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "reasoning",
              "text": "The gap in R4 is on the right side, opening toward the right. The C shape opens right. The gap is on the right, slightly... The upper endpoint is at the right upper area, lower endpoint at right lower area. The opening faces right.\n\nCompare with current R43 (current.png) - also appears to open right, similar.\n\nAnswer: 缺口朝右（右侧开口）。\n\nLet me describe more precisely: 细笔画初稿 R4 是一个 \"C\" 形环，缺口位于右侧，开口朝右。This is similar to current.\n\nI should confirm direction — the arc is drawn from about 2 o'clock going counterclockwise around to about 4 o'clock, so gap faces right/right-slightly. Yes, gap on right side.\n\nAnswer concisely."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**潮位标记 · 细笔画初稿（R4）的缺口朝右。**\n\n这条 C 形环是从右上约 2 点钟方向开始，逆时针绕大半圈到右下约 4 点钟方向，所以环的开口落在**右侧**，正好朝右。线条较细，缺口开得也比较窄。\n\n补充一点：这版和当前稿 R43 的开口方向一致，都是朝右，主要差别在线宽；R6 的粗笔画新稿和 R42 的最近修改稿也是同一朝向，但笔画明显加粗。如果你需要，我可以把这几版的轮廓提取出来，逐像素对比缺口角度。"
            }
          ],
